_:na35a4a865f7b43de9e465527bd4ce4e3b4 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        The value of a rml:innerJoin property for a rml:LogicalView must be a resource.\n        " .
_:n4f387b3fbeed48f88651010fdcd757d7b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/iterator> .
