<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractExpressionMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Expression Map must have one of rml:template, rml:constant, or\n    rml:reference, unless rml:termType is rml:BlankNode with no expression.\n    " .
_:nb9f566c8c8844b48809efaf862f9f788b16 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:object must be an IRI and be provided once.\n        " .
