_:na35a4a865f7b43de9e465527bd4ce4e3b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        At least one rml:field property must be specified for a rml:LogicalView, with either an rml:ExpressionField or an rml:IterableField its value.\n        " .
