_:naff389d478b848c4bed9a6575fb7fb12b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:parentTriplesMap may only be provided once and must be an IRI\n        or Blank Node referring to a Triples Map.\n        " .
_:na35a4a865f7b43de9e465527bd4ce4e3b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#inversePath> _:na35a4a865f7b43de9e465527bd4ce4e3b12 .
