_:na35a4a865f7b43de9e465527bd4ce4e3b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        Inclusion (and ForeignKey) annotations targeting this logical view\n        via rml:targetView. Reached via the inverse of rml:targetView, not\n        rml:structuralAnnotation -- an InclusionAnnotation is the SUBJECT\n        of rml:targetView, not this view's own value, so it isn't\n        otherwise reachable from here; without this property it would\n        never get checked at all.\n        " .
_:n55447e36e9394d9fa32a0cafd7d8cefdb1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:mode specifies in which mode the target is opened such as read-only,\n        write-only, both, etc.\n        " .
