_:n50135f2ef1a248db8764be00a21074f7b2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:root defines the root against which a relative rml:path is\n        resolved: rml:CurrentWorkingDirectory, rml:MappingDirectory, or an\n        absolute path string Literal. Defaults to\n        rml:CurrentWorkingDirectory if not specified.\n        " .
_:n4f387b3fbeed48f88651010fdcd757d7b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        rml:iterator specifies the iterator to iterate over\r\n        the data source, and may be provided at most once.\r\n        " .
